 \n\nRosebud Baker is a comedian\, actor\, and Emmy-nominated writer. Named
  to Variety’s “Top 10 Comics to Watch\,” and Vulture’s “Comedi
 ans You Should and Will Know” lists\, Rosebud wrote for Saturday Night 
 Live from 2022 to 2025. She has written and performed on two Writers Gui
 ld Award–nominated shows\, That Damn Michael Che and Inside Amy Schumer
 \, and won the WGA Award for her work on the latter.\n\nHer debut stand-up
  special\, Whiskey Fists\, premiered on YouTube in 2021\, produced by Bil
 l Burr and All Things Comedy. Her Netflix special\, The Mother Lode\, pr
 emiered in February 2025.\n\nHer acting work can be seen in Life & Beth o
 n Hulu\, That Damn Michael Che on HBO\, and the horror-comedy feature fil
 m Hell of a Summer.\n\nShe is based in New York\, where she lives and wor
 ks (when she’s not on a plane to go live and work somewhere else)..\n\
